WEBVTT

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.380
<i>I don't remember how it started.</i>

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.790
<i>As far back as I can remember,
it's what I always wanted to be:</i>

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.380
<i>The Eminence in Shadow.</i>

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.000
Alpha...

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.460
Everything you said turned out to be true.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.750
I looked in those ancient texts

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.170
and found a description of what we
believe to be the Cult of Diablos.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.750
As I suspected.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.000
The more we learn,
the more powerful they appear to be.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.830
Nevertheless, I...

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.920
We lurk in the shadows, and hunt the shadows.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.420
<i>Yes, that's what I want.</i>

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.710
<i>That is how I will finally become
the Eminence in Shadow.</i>

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.670
<i>But man, this elf is a pushover.</i>

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:34.000
<b>#2: Shadow Garden Is Born</b>

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.420
<i>The last summer of my high school career,</i>

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.290
<i>I, Minoru Kageno,</i>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.920
<b>Deceased ~ Minoru Kageno (18)</b>

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.420
<i>was following the path to becoming
the Eminence in Shadow,</i>

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.460
<i>when my journey seemed to be cut drastically short.</i>

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.540
Claire always wanted a little brother!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.920
She'll be overjoyed!

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.170
<i>What the...</i>

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.420
But something's not right.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.830
He's not crying at all.

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.830
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:05.290
Waah! Waah!

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.000
What a hearty cry!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.790
I must have been imagining things.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.790
<i>I have no idea how or why this could have happened.</i>

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.920
<i>But that's just a minor detail.</i>

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.330
<i>More importantly, the air is filled with magical energy.</i>

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:26.000
<i>In my past life, magic was the stuff
of dreams and fairy tales.</i>

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.130
<i>But now I can claim this
overwhelming power for my own.</i>

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.750
<i>That's the only thing that matters.</i>

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.830
<i>With this power, I can...</i>

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.460
<i>Uh, I pooped.</i>

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:45.790
Waah! Waah!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.250
<i>Oh, before I forget,</i>

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.210
<i>I was reborn as the son of Baron Kagenou,
an aristocrat living out in the boonies.</i>

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.170
<i>For generations, this family has
pumped out Dark Knights,</i>

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.920
<i>fencers that enhance their
physical abilities using magic.</i>

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:01.130
<i>And everyone has high hopes for the Kagenou heir....</i>

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.880
<i>who is not me.</i>

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.710
<i>Hidden in the shadow of my abundantly talented sister,</i>

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:16.380
<i>I grew up as the average, ordinary
Dark Knight in Training Background Character A.</i>

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:18.710
<i>But under that exterior...</i>

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.080
I see business is booming, my dear bandits!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.830
So kindly show me all your valuables.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.130
Don't get cocky with us, kid!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:34.630
He just...

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.330
You, over there, enough idle chitchat.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.830
I said, show me the money.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.920
A slime sword...

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.250
Nice, isn't it?

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:55.580
Wow, it's even more useful than I thought it'd be.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.290
Uh, wait...

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.750
All right, fine...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.080
Next...

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.170
I can test it on you.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:07.040
If you really work at it,
you can survive for about two minutes.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.130
So hang in there.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.920
Don't mock me, boy!

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.210
Surprised?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:16.960
I might not look like much,
but I'm a Bushinryu master!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.080
Just kidding.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.170
You didn't last two minutes.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.250
Yup, I'm really happy with this slime bodysuit, too.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.250
My caravan friends, I have avenged you.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.250
Don't worry, I will make good use
of the gifts you left behind.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.670
Money, art, food, and...

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.880
A cage? Is it a slave?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.460
This is unexpected.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.250
You're not a corpse.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.580
You've started to rot, but you're still alive.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.880
Which means you're possessed?

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.540
That wavelength...

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:10.830
I've felt it before.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.830
It's just like a magical overload.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.210
I can use this blob.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.210
It's not my body,

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.460
so I can do anything I want with it
without hurting myself.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.630
<i>After that, I started shooting it up with magic.</i>

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.830
<i>I tried all kinds of things that didn't work
in a period of exhilarating experimentation.</i>

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.330
<i>Then, one month later...</i>

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:43.000
<i>I finally succeeded in containing the magical overload.</i>

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.750
<i>But...</i>

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.330
Oh, man...

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.880
Who knew something that decomposed
could revert to normal?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.920
<i>Uh-oh! What do I do now?</i>

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.460
<i>Oh! I have an idea!</i>

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.790
<i>Stay sharp.</i>

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.920
<i>This is your first performance as
the Eminence in Shadow.</i>

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.830
I see you've awakened.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.960
I'm...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.750
But I can't be!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.500
I have broken the curse that was
gnawing away at you.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.670
You're free now.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:35.540
You did this?

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:37.580
What curse?

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.920
Yes, the curse, it's...

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.130
...a terrible curse that was cast on you
and the other heroes' descendants.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.790
I understand your consternation.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.380
But surely you, too, have heard of it.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.130
The fairy tale recorded in the scriptures,

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:57.880
about three heroes who defeated the demon Diablos
and saved the world.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.420
That story is true.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.080
And the demon, with his dying breath, cast a curse.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:09.170
That is what really turned you into
that rotting lump of flesh.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.130
But someone has twisted history,

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.880
and turned you into objects of scorn,
calling you possessed.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.130
And the one behind it all is...

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.630
Yes, the mastermind is...

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:29.170
No, it's too soon to speak the name.
If you knew, you would only be in danger.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.380
I don't care.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.540
Who did this to me?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.580
I see...

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.830
In that case, I'll tell you...

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.830
The Cult of Diablos...

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:44.290
a group of zealots who are plotting
to revive the great demon.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:47.630
They never come out into the light of day.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:52.170
My mission is to remain in the shadows,
to put an end to their evil schemes.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.380
I guess.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.290
Yes, my name is Stylish-

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.290
Sorry.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.830
My name is Shadow.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.000
He who lurks in the shadows to hunt the shadows.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.040
Shadow...

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.630
My path is not an easy one,

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.170
but I must fulfill my mission.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.460
Child of the Heroes,

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:18.540
are you prepared to walk my path with me?

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:20.920
When I fell ill-

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:25.960
I mean, when I was struck with the curse,
I lost everything.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:31.080
My only future was to waste away as a hideous beast,
but you saved me.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.960
So...

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.250
If it is what you wish,

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.750
I will give you my life.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.080
And I will punish the guilty with death.

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:50.210
<i>I mean, I made the whole thing up.</i>

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.500
We'll probably be up against powerful
government leaders and stuff.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.630
And I'm sure there will be many people
under their control who don't know the truth.

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:02.040
Nevertheless, I cannot show mercy
to any who stand in our way.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:04.330
Yes, good! That's the spirit!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:09.290
We will need to find the other hero descendants
and take them under our wing.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.380
Uh, right.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.540
As we expand our organization,

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.540
we'll need to strengthen our
base of operations accordingly.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.170
We'll need to collect funds to that end.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.960
Yeah, but in moderation.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.750
Okay, then, uh, right...

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.670
We'll call our organization...

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.420
Shadow Garden.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.290
And your name is now Alpha.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:34.710
<i>Three years passed after I brilliantly ad-libbed
my way through my first performance.</i>

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.830
<i>I was now 13 years old,
an average, ordinary Dark Knight in training.</i>

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.130
Your lunge is weak!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.210
<i>The fencing in this world, in a word, is unsophisticated.</i>

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.920
<i>In my past life, living in the Age of Information,</i>

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:59.330
<i>I was able to fuse all kinds of
martial arts together and optimize them.</i>

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:00.750
<i>If I just used them here...</i>

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.500
Jeez! You're too strong!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.210
That boy never makes any progress.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.380
Miss Claire...

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.630
Yes?

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.330
Your mother is calling.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.960
The guests are arriving for your farewell party.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.130
Cid, I won't be able to practice with you for a while,

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.170
but you make sure to continue training on your own.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.380
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.750
You, prepare a towel and
a change of clothes for the boy.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.630
Oh, man, it's not easy to play the part
of a background character.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:42.790
<i>But I must play Background Character A perfectly
if I want to be ready for the day I know will come.</i>

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.580
<i>When nobles turn fifteen,</i>

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:54.290
<i>they start attending the Midgar Academy
for Dark Knights in the royal capital.</i>

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:59.080
<i>My sister is enrolled at the Midgar Academy
for Dark Knights, too, but...</i>

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.380
<i>When the day came for her departure...</i>

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.250
<i>she was nowhere to be found.</i>

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.540
What is the meaning of this?!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.210
Even attacking her in her sleep,
how could they overpower Claire?!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.920
The scoundrel must have been a master fighter!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.040
Then we have to accept this?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.210
Is that what you're saying?

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.500
Oh, no, that's not what I meant.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.290
I was just stating a fact-

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.880
Stop making excuses, bald man!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.670
Take that and that and that!
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!<b></b>

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.420
Go find our daughter, dammit!

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:39.880
What are we going to do
if something happens to poor Claire?!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:41.790
Beta...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.630
Yes, Lord Shadow?

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:48.710
<i>Alpha had collected members for Shadow Garden
as if she was adopting abandoned kittens.</i>

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.330
<i>So our numbers have grown rapidly.</i>

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.380
Where's Alpha?

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.670
Searching for clues to finding Miss Claire.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:56.630
She moves fast.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.380
Is my sister still alive?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.580
Most likely, yes.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.580
The kidnapper, as expected,
belongs to the Cult of Diablos,

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.040
a high-ranking officer.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.710
Why did they take my sister?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:09.420
We believe they suspect that Miss Claire is
one of the heroes' descendants.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.630
I see.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.790
<i>I guess when these girls get involved,</i>

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.540
<i>even regular old bandits can instantly
transform into members of the cult.</i>

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.750
Look at this map.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.000
We have determined the locations of their hideouts.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:24.250
But we don't know which hideout is the one
where they are keeping Miss Claire.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.460
That one.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.290
<i>Darnit, I missed!</i>

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.460
That is where we'll find my sister.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.960
B-but there's nothing there...

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.290
It can't be!
These cryptograms were a bluff?!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.670
In that case, if we compare it against this account...

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.130
It all comes together!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:48.380
Lord Shadow, I believe there is a secret hideout
in the location you indicated!

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.580
I knew it.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:53.080
You took in this enormous amount of information
and saw the truth in an instant!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.290
I'm so impressed!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.080
<i>You're quite the actress, Beta.</i>

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.830
<i>You deserve an Academy Award.</i>

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.670
Contact the Seven Shadows.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.500
We move tonight.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.710
Yes, My Lord!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:11.170
You know, I had a daughter.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.920
I would prefer not to have to resort to violence...

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.580
Claire Kagenou.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.170
You can still dodge that while locked up
in magic-sealing chains?

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.130
I was taught that it's not about how much
magic you have, but how you use it.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.040
You had a good father.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.460
That baldy?

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.580
No, I was taught by my brother.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.130
Your brother?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.330
When we fight, I beat him every time.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.920
But I am always learning from my brother's sword.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:45.000
And yet he never learns a thing from me.

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.330
That's why I pick on him every day.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:49.500
I've heard about your brother.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.380
When you showed signs of possession,
he is the one that healed you, right?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.500
Not that again.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.420
I keep telling people, that's not what happened.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.630
There is no way that boy could have healed me.

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.630
That is certainly true.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:05.000
But just in case, I'm going to need to learn
more about this brother of yours.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.830
If anything happens to that boy,

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.580
you'll have to answer to me!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.040
You! You mutilated your own hands?!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:18.420
I'll kill you, I'll kill your beloved family,
your friends, everyone you-

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.040
Cheeky little brat.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.290
No matter.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.000
We'll know if she's compatible once
we've analyzed her blood.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.000
Viscount Grease!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.250
What do you want?!

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:32.460
Intruders!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.790
We think there are seven of them!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.830
They appear out of nowhere, like shadows!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.500
Our men are dropping like flies!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.330
We're no match for them!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.830
That's impossible!

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:49.960
Some of our knights are good enough
to be in the Royal Guard!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.290
What the?!

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:00.830
Y-you...

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.540
Who are you?

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.580
We are Shadow Garden.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.290
It is our mission in life to
annihilate the Cult of Diablos.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.710
We know everything.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:15.750
About the revival of the demon Diablos,
the heroes' descendants...

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.500
...and the truth behind demon possession.

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.580
The Cult of Diablos?!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.790
Where did you learn that name?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.670
How did you find that secret?!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.040
I won't kill you.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.170
At least, not before you tell us everything you know.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.750
That was an interesting trick.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.670
I'll go after him.

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.000
No need.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:21.830
He's headed straight for him.

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:24.750
Is that why we split up?

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.710
Lord Shadow is so brilliant!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.500
I'm lost.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.210
I guess I got a little carried away hunting the small fry.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.000
Dammit...

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.330
You knew I was coming this way?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.210
But there's only one of you!

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.830
In terms of quantity,
you have more magic power than Alpha.

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:03.750
But unfortunately, you have no idea how to use it.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.250
And yes...

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.290
your lunge is weak.

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.790
Your fighting has absolutely no finesse.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:18.040
Allow me to give you a master class
on the correct use of magic.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.130
Lesson One:

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:26.580
Concentrate a minimum amount of magical energy
in your feet for a burst of speed.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.000
Lesson Two:

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.710
Once you've gained the proper distance from your
opponent, speed and strength are unnecessary.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.170
You don't even need magic.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.750
Lesson Three:

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.630
I'm only just getting started!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:51.750
<i>Have I ever felt so overwhelmed in battle before?</i>

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.500
<i>If I have, it was as a boy.</i>

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:58.750
<i>When I was sparring against my teacher,
after I had only just taken up the sword.</i>

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.130
But...

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:06.880
I don't care how stong you are,

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:11.750
the darkness of this world is so much deeper

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.670
than even you can imagine!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.540
Then I'll dive deeper.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.420
As deep as I can go.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:28.830
I'm serious, boy!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.580
I'll teach you something!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.250
About the darkness of this world!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.960
We're all worthless!
And fragile!

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.670
That is reality!
Taste it for yourself!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.750
Your own powerlessness!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.460
Disgraceful.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:01.290
What is this?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.830
This enormous magical energy?!

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.790
Playtime's over.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.000
<i>Of course...</i>

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:21.000
<i>It's not just his technique...</i>

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.330
<i>It's everything!</i>

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:28.420
<i>I was powerless against the darkness.</i>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:32.330
<i>But maybe this boy...</i>

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.000
<i>Millia...</i>

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.750
He was pretty tough for a regular old bandit.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:06.170
<i>Well, that's pretty much how we
successfully pulled off this rescue mission.</i>

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:12.000
<i>After breaking out of her chains, Claire showed up
back home the next day in a very bad mood.</i>

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.580
<i>She is ridiculously tenacious.</i>

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.250
<i>And her injuries were more or less healed overnight.</i>

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:20.750
<i>She set out for the royal capital
as if nothing had ever happened.</i>

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.250
<i>I wish I could go to the capital.</i>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.960
<i>It's a giant metropolis that doesn't even
compare to this backwater village.</i>

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:41.040
<i>There's bound to be some character there
in the position of main protagonist.</i>

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.710
<i>And I bet there's a last boss, too.</i>

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.130
<i>Well, I'll get to go there in two years.</i>

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.710
<i>In the meantime, I'll put Alpha and the girls to work...</i>

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.250
Shadow...

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.080
The hour has come.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.540
It is time for us to leave you.

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:03.540
What?

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.580
This is goodbye.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.000
<i>What?</i>
